 ects\, cultural heritage initiatives\, gender/diversity programmes\, small
 -scale software development and content campaigns.\n\nOrganisation: Wikime
 dia Foundation\nLocation: Worldwide (subject to legal eligibility by count
 ry)\nAward: $500 to $5\,000 USD per grant (distributed in local-currency e
