 sals for exhibitions anywhere outside NYC (USD 10\,000 per exhibition)
DESCRIPTION:apexart's Open Calls turn a curatorial idea into a funded apexa
 rt exhibition\, selected by a crowdsourced international jury of more than
  600 people in 70 countries. WHO CAN SUBMIT: anyone\, from anywhere\, with
  no fees at any level: trained and student curators\, artists\, writers an
 d creative people regardless of experience\, background or location.\n\nOr
 ganisation: apexart\nLocation: Exhibitions in apexart's New York City spac
 e (October call) or anywhere in the world except NYC (February call). Anyo
 ne\, from anywhere\, can submit.\nAward: USD 10\,000 per selected exhibiti
 on: USD 8\,000 for expenses (curator travel\, artwork shipping\, artist an
 d participant honorariums\, equipment\, installation) plus an honorarium o
 f up to USD 2\,000 for the curator/organizer. For exhibitions outside NYC\
 , apexart matches up to USD 1\,000 for venue rental if needed. apexart add
 itionally covers insurance\, advertising\, publicity\, brochure design/pri
 nting/mailing\, the opening reception and (for NYC) documentation\, and ha
 ndles most logistics. No application fee.\nDuration: Proposal window 1 Feb
 ruary to 1 March 2027 for the 2027-28 international exhibition season\; ju
 ry voting in March. The separate NYC call runs every October.\n\nMore: htt
 ps://apexart.org/opencallsprocess.php?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdes
 k&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://apexart.org/opencallsprocess.php?utm_source=artificialnouveaugr
 antdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Exhibitions in apexart's New York City space (October call) or any
 where in the world except NYC (February call). Anyone\, from anywhere\, ca
 n submit.
END:VEVENT
