SUMMARY:Deadline 12:00 CET: Kulturstiftung des Bundes: General Project Fund
 ing\, January 2027 round (Allgemeine Projektfoerderung)
DESCRIPTION:Closes 31 Jan 2027 at 12:00 CET.\n\nWinter round of Germany's f
 lagship open\, non-thematic federal project line\, one of the largest Euro
 pean funders that will back a festival\, exhibition programme or multi-par
 tner convening run by an organisation rather than an individual artist.\n\
 nOrganisation: Kulturstiftung des Bundes (German Federal Cultural Foundati
 on)\nLocation: Activity must be visible to audiences in Germany. Instituti
 ons headquartered in Germany or abroad may apply.\nAward: No fixed ceiling
 \, but total project costs must exceed EUR 50\,000 to be eligible. The Fou
 ndation allocates up to EUR 10 million per year across this line. At least
  20 percent of total project costs must be secured from own capital and/or
  third-party funding. No application fee.\nDuration: Project-length. Proje
 cts may not begin before the jury meeting.\n\nMore: https://www.kulturstif
 tung-des-bundes.de/en/themes_focuses/general_project_funding.html?utm_sour
 ce=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://www.kulturstiftung-des-bundes.de/en/themes_focuses/general_proj
 ect_funding.html?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Activity must be visible to audiences in Germany. Institutions hea
 dquartered in Germany or abroad may apply.
END:VEVENT
